    "identifier": "jiton-magnet-release-dust-world-order",
    "description": "<p>You collect your Dust particles into a single point in the air, before you create a magnificent structure of geometric branching spikes that shoot randomly in every direction covering every possible angle and vector. All creatures within the affected area must make a Dexterity saving throw.</p>\n<p>Critical Success: Affected creature takes half of 6d6 earth damage.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creature takes half of 6d6 earth damage and are Staggered.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures takes 6d6 earth damage are Dazed and Staggered.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure, but the affected creature takes 8d6 earth damage and are Stunned.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the size of the area by +10-feet.</p>",
